            <ArticleTitle>[Role of smoking in chronic broncho-pulmonary diseases in workers of Far East Railway].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>46-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Smoking contributes more than occupational factors into broncho-pulmonary diseases development and into free-radical process disorders among Far East Railway workers. The data obtained should be considered in specifying treatment and prophylactic measures in these workers.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
